  "rationale": "Block configSecret:credentialAccess and ssoLogin:authenticate. This makes dbLogin, monitoringHost, and jumpHost unreachable, cutting off codeRepo and vaultRead. It also disables both prerequisites routes to dbReplica (localAdmin and serviceAccount), while blocking ssoLogin disables secretsManager and thus shareMount. All four target parents are therefore unreachable. One block cannot suffice: the route through configSecret → monitoringHost → codeRepo and a complete AND/OR derivation through secretsManager → shareMount use disjoint sets of blockable steps, so no single step can stop both."
